<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Sui Northern Gas up 1.44 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Sui Northern Gas up 1.44 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Sui Northern Gas gained 0.60 rupees, or 1.44 percent, to 42.35 in early Karachi trade following last week's government order for a 10 percent rise in gas prices as part of an economic stabilisation package, dealers said.</p>
<p>A turnover of 3,000 Sui Northern shares was recorded in early trade.</p>
<p>&quot;The increase in gas prices will result in better earnings for the gas companies,&quot; dealer Ali Asghar said.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
